OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who spells by blinking is
OL,4,Adenied chance to sit exam
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter months of work, she completed the
OL,7,Fcoursework for National 4 (Nat 4)
OL,8,Fhistory and achieved a qualification
OL,9,Flast year.
